  "result": "Perfect! All 85 tests pass, including 19 new discount tests. The line discount feature is complete:\n\n**What was added:**\n- **DISCOUNT_INVALID** error code for invalid discount values\n- **discountAmount(line)** helper that calculates discount as lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent \u00f7 100 (rounded to nearest cent)\n- **invoiceTotals** now returns `{ subtotal, discount, total }` where total = max(0, subtotal - discount)\n- **createInvoice** and **addLine** now accept optional `discountPercent` (0-100, decimals allowed)\n- Validation rejects negative discounts, values > 100, and non-numeric inputs\n- Only stores `discountPercent` on lines when > 0 (keeps objects clean)\n- Total is clamped to zero\u2014never goes negative\n\n**Tests added cover:**\n- Storing and omitting discount on lines\n- Validation of discount values\n- Decimal discounts (e.g., 12.5%)\n- discountAmount calculation with rounding\n- invoiceTotals with single/multiple lines and varied discounts\n- Clamping when discount exceeds subtotal\n- Integration with addLine",
